  "term": "vitamin",
  "definition": "In this mental health context, a vitamin refers to a natural product such as vitamin D that some people use in hopes of easing depression symptoms. The source notes that such products are not FDA-approved for treating depression, research findings are mixed, and they may have risks including interactions with prescription medicines.",
